; ========================================
; 魔法少女ノ魔女裁判 第2章2話
; ========================================

# Scene2-2-1

; ========================================
; ●シーン2‐2‐1
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:6_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8
@ShowToastUI Text:"第２部　第２章|#Toast_107|"
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_26_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:自从玛格被处刑后过了几天——|#0202Adv01_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:早上，我来到食堂吃早餐。<br>其他少女也都在食堂里。|#0202Adv01_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛自然也在其中——|#0202Adv01_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉，汉娜，早上好。|#0202Adv01_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:早上好！<br>咦，艾玛，你就吃这么点啊？|#0202Adv01_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:60 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:经过餐桌时我无意间听见了这番对话，<br>便看向那边，<br>只见艾玛手里只拿着一个苹果。|#0202Adv01_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:是、是的……我没什么食欲。|#0202Adv01_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然能理解你的心情啦……<br>不过，为了维持体力，<br>还是多吃一点比较好哦。|#0202Adv01_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜的告诫虽然是对艾玛说的，但更像是在给自己找理由。<br>她正狼吞虎咽地吃着早餐。|#0202Adv01_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我一边走向取餐区，<br>一边环顾其他少女。|#0202Adv01_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看上去，<br>没有一个人在享受这早饭。|#0202Adv01_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:差到极点的卖相和味道的确是原因之一，<br>但我想，原因大概不止如此。|#0202Adv01_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露被杀，玛格作为凶手被处刑。|#0202Adv01_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:案件留下的恐惧<br>不可能在短短数日内就消散。|#0202Adv01_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（其实我也没有食欲，可是不能不吃……<br>　谁知道未来会发生什么）|#0202Adv01_Hiro001|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在一片死气沉沉中，<br>我走到取餐处。|#0202Adv01_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:各种饭菜摆满了整张桌子，<br>可是每一样食物都黯淡无光，菜色十分不新鲜。|#0202Adv01_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:冰冷的汤水、焉掉的菜叶、<br>黑漆漆的硬面包、<br>黏在瓶子上的诡异液体……|#0202Adv01_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:即使每天都是这样，<br>但我还是每次都很难决定到底该用什么果腹。|#0202Adv01_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:今天去调查哪里呢？|#0202Adv01_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……去哪里呢。<br>有疑点的地方基本都调查过了。|#0202Adv01_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:话说回来真是吓我一跳。<br>没想到还能从招待所<br>走到那样的地下设施……|#0202Adv01_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:正当我手里拿着夹子犹豫不决时，<br>艾玛她们的说话声又飘进了耳朵里。|#0202Adv01_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（地下设施吗……）|#0202Adv01_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#00000000 Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000FF Duration:1 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

