@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#00000000 Duration:1 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

[PrintTextModified Text:审判过后。|#0202Adv01_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:大家一起逼问可可，<br>她才不情不愿地带我们去了招待所。|#0202Adv01_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:本想着“这种地方能有什么东西”……|#0202Adv01_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0.5 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:23_4

[PrintTextModified Text:到了以后我们才发现，<br>【水精之室】里竟藏着秘密楼梯，这让我们震惊不已。|#0202Adv01_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0.5 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:31_1

[PrintTextModified Text:顺着楼梯走到半地下层，<br>便看到一部电梯。|#0202Adv01_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们打算赶紧乘上电梯，可是才进去3个人，<br>就响起了警示音。|#0202Adv01_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:大概是因为轿厢太旧，已经年久失修，<br>所以承受不了太多重量吧。|#0202Adv01_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:没办法，我们只好两人一组，分开乘电梯下去。|#0202Adv01_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:于是到了下层，我们看到的是——|#0202Adv01_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0.5 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:25_1

[PrintTextModified Text:一片令人惊奇的地下设施。|#0202Adv01_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在这里，<br>我们注意到一个神秘的控制面板。|#0202Adv01_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:据可可所说，这个仪器是用来更换处刑台的，<br>最好不要随便碰。|#0202Adv01_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0.5 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:26_1

[PrintTextModified Text:旁边还有个巨型冷冻室。<br>这是让我们最震惊的设施。|#0202Adv01_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:无数具【魔女的残骸】<br>和牺牲的少女们——<br>全都被冰封保存在这里。|#0202Adv01_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#00000000 Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000FF Duration:1 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
