@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#00000000 Duration:1 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

[PrintTextModified Text:呜呜，光是想起来就冷得发抖……！|#0202Adv01_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:也许是和我一样回想起了在冷冻室的看到的场面，<br>艾玛浑身发起抖来。|#0202Adv01_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:既然有处刑装置那样的大型机关，<br>那地下有个这么大的设施也不奇怪。|#0202Adv01_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……不过要是能找到<br>越狱的线索就好了……|#0202Adv01_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就是说呀。<br>如果有个从地下逃往岛外的海底隧道什么的<br>该有多好！|#0202Adv01_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:就算真的有，<br>估计也不会让我们轻易逃走吧。|#0202Adv01_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:可恶！真叫人恼火！|#0202Adv01_Hanna004| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:好、好啦好啦……<br>大家不要放弃，继续调查看看吧。|#0202Adv01_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:监牢后面还有个大型仓库，<br>说不定能在那里找到些什么能用来越狱的东西哦。|#0202Adv01_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（啊……说起来我们还找到了一处仓库）|#0202Adv01_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000FF Duration:0.6 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.6
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:24_1

@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#00000000 Duration:0.6 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.6

[PrintTextModified Text:被关在这里的头几天，<br>我就很好奇后面那个上锁的房间是做什么的。|#0202Adv01_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可是，不知从何时起，门上的锁被取下了。<br>这使得我们也能随意进出了。|#0202Adv01_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（地下设施也好，这个仓库也好，<br>　大概原本都是只有监牢管理方才能进出的<br>　后方工作区域）|#0202Adv01_Hiro004|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（也许是幕后黑手梅露露的死亡<br>　给管理方带来了混乱吧……）|#0202Adv01_Hiro005|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:感觉它们对我们的监视力度和规定执行力，<br>似乎都变得漏洞百出了。|#0202Adv01_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#00000000 Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000FF Duration:0.6 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.6

