@Wait WaitMode:0.8

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Determined2

[PrintTextModified Text:大家不要放弃，一起寻找逃出去的办法吧！|#0202Adv01_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:听见艾玛说着鼓舞人心的话，<br>我一下子火上心头。|#0202Adv01_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（不要放弃？<br>　你也好意思说这话……！）|#0202Adv01_Hiro006|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:回过神来，我发现自己竟然在竖起耳朵<br>偷听她们交谈。|#0202Adv01_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（冷静……我要冷静……）|#0202Adv01_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我长长地吐了一口气，<br>轻轻摇头。|#0202Adv01_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（……现在生气<br>　也只会给自己增添压力）|#0202Adv01_Hiro008|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我强行把注意力从艾玛身上拉开。|#0202Adv01_Narrative037| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:胡乱取了一些食物，<br>便独自坐下就餐。|#0202Adv01_Narrative038| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么可可会知道那个秘密的地下设施？<br>这也令我很在意。|#0202Adv01_Narrative039| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:一把饭送进嘴里，<br>我就把视线转向了可可和米莉亚那桌。|#0202Adv01_Narrative040| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:大叔啊，<br>你最好还是跟大家说清楚<br>交换身体的魔法是怎么一回事吧？|#0202Adv01_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:我感觉有几个人真的以为<br>你的灵魂是大叔。|#0202Adv01_Coco002| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:没关系啦。她们爱怎么想都可以……|#0202Adv01_Miria001| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:话说你真的能交换身体？<br>换给我看看呗。|#0202Adv01_Coco003| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:不不不，万一换不回来就头大了，还是算了吧。<br>以前我就因为这事遇上过大麻烦……|#0202Adv01_Miria002| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:你就把大叔我当作不会魔法的<br>普通大叔吧。|#0202Adv01_Miria003| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:对了小可，<br>关于那个地下设施，<br>能不能告诉大叔我，你还知道些什么……|#0202Adv01_Miria004| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:又问这个？不是都告诉你们了嘛。<br>我只是用千里眼魔法<br>看到了前往地下设施的路径而已啦。|#0202Adv01_Coco004| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（不管大家怎么逼问她，她都只<br>　模棱两可地给出魔法这个托词）|#0202Adv01_Hiro009|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:"（看样子她肯定知道什么内幕……<br>　真不好对付）|#0202Adv01_Hiro010|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@UpdateWitchBook Id:Miria Category:Profile Version:7

[PrintTextModified Text:尽管我也想严厉地追问下去，<br>不过，最近我一直在刻意回避和其他少女接触。|#0202Adv01_Narrative041| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（目前我只想尽量断绝和大家的关联）|#0202Adv01_Hiro011| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:从我决心杀死艾玛的那一刻起——<br>就决定要远离其他人了。|#0202Adv01_Narrative042| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所以我选择独自在远离人群的餐桌落座，<br>尽量让自己吃点东西。|#0202Adv01_Narrative043| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙、奈叶香和蕾雅也都是独自吃饭，<br>所以我的举动并没有多么格格不入。|#0202Adv01_Narrative044| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Normal1,Angle01/Option_Arms-

[PrintTextModified Text:安安，<br>这个黑黑的像西蓝花一样的东西你吃吗？|#0202Adv01_Noah001| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:不吃。你不想吃为什么还拿。|#0202Adv01_AnAn001| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:因为它长得很有意思啊……<br>呜呜，不知道可不可以剩菜……|#0202Adv01_Noah002| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚出现在视野里，<br>我急忙扭开视线。|#0202Adv01_Narrative045| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:最近，诺亚经常和安安一起吃饭。|#0202Adv01_Narrative046| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我和诺亚自从上次小吵一架之后，就有了隔阂，<br>于是我们的关系也渐渐有些疏远了。|#0202Adv01_Narrative047| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（……这样就好。<br>　我不该和任何人亲近）|#0202Adv01_Hiro012|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亲近别人，就意味着放松警惕。会让人有可趁之机。<br>如今我已经有了明确的目标，就应该保持孤身一人。|#0202Adv01_Narrative048| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000FF Duration:0.5 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.5

[PrintTextModified Text:"（没错……我要杀了艾玛。<br>　我只需贯彻这个目标就好）|#0202Adv01_Hiro013|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:握住勺子的手陡然用力。|#0202Adv01_Narrative049| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（但我不能随意动手。<br>　只要罪行暴露，<br>　就会在魔女审判中被处刑……）|#0202Adv01_Hiro014|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（要下手，就必须是完美犯罪。<br>　要先从制定计划开始）|#0202Adv01_Hiro015|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（制定一个<br>　任何人都无法发现是我杀了艾玛的计划）|#0202Adv01_Hiro016|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

