@Wait WaitMode:0.5

[PrintTextModified Text:"（如果像玛格杀害梅露露一样，<br>　使用凶器杀人倒是简单）|#0202Adv01_Hiro017|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:2 Duration:0.5 Lazy:false ScenePosition:100,20 AppearanceAndTransition:320_1

[PrintTextModified Text:"（玛格用过的那把剑……<br>　应该能用作防身武器）|#0202Adv01_Hiro018|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格用作凶器的仪礼剑已经被典狱长收走，<br>放回了这把剑原本所在的保险箱里。|#0202Adv01_Narrative050| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（虽然从保险箱里拿出来也不是不行，<br>　但引人怀疑的行动，还是避免为好……）|#0202Adv01_Hiro019|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Stills Lazy:false
@ResetText

; ゆっくり歩く足音・1人
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_97 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:1.5

[PrintTextModified Text:正想着，一阵脚步声渐近，停在我的旁边。|#0202Adv01_Narrative051| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:我看向身旁，<br>蕾雅一副欲言又止的表情站在那里。|#0202Adv01_Narrative052| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……找我有事？|#0202Adv01_Hiro020| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不，也说不上有什么事……|#0202Adv01_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:见我如此露骨地表示冷漠，<br>蕾雅有些露怯。|#0202Adv01_Narrative053| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:我看你好像身体不太舒服，<br>就有点担心。<br>如果身体有什么不适——|#0202Adv01_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Surprised1

; 皿が割れる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_20 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:你胡说八道什么呢！|#0202Adv01_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:突然，怒吼声和盘子破碎声同时响起。|#0202Adv01_Narrative054| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_26_2 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:60 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:40 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,ArmL6,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙抓住奈叶香的领口，<br>愈发大声吼道。|#0202Adv01_Narrative055| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不是说了我不知道吗！|#0202Adv01_Alisa002| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:真的吗？|#0202Adv01_Nanoka001| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你烦不烦！<br>上来就污蔑别人是小偷！|#0202Adv01_Alisa003| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:两人脸都快贴到一起了，火药味十足地瞪着彼此。|#0202Adv01_Narrative056| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:等、等等……！<br>你们都冷静点！|#0202Adv01_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛等人慌忙挡在两人之间。|#0202Adv01_Narrative057| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你们在吵什么呢？|#0202Adv01_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka

[PrintTextModified Text:发带。|#0202Adv01_Nanoka002| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香简短而冷淡地回答了雪莉的疑问。|#0202Adv01_Narrative058| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:……啊？什么意思？|#0202Adv01_Hanna005| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka

[PrintTextModified Text:我的发带不见了。<br>能想到的地方我都找过了，但都没找到。|#0202Adv01_Nanoka003| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:也就是说，我们囚犯之中有小偷。<br>而她是最可疑的。|#0202Adv01_Nanoka004| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,ArmL6,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:你这家伙……！|#0202Adv01_Alisa004| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙挥起拳头。|#0202Adv01_Narrative059| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1
@Wait WaitMode:0.2
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:35 IdAndAppearance:Ema

[PrintTextModified Text:不、不能这样，亚里沙！|#0202Adv01_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:吵死了，一边去！<br>关你屁事！|#0202Adv01_Alisa005| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:——住手！|#0202Adv01_Leia003| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一触即发的食堂里，突然响起正气凛然的声音。<br>在众人的注视下，蕾雅静静开口道。|#0202Adv01_Narrative060| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙，奈叶香。<br>希望你们二位先冷静一下。|#0202Adv01_Leia004| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:40 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:60 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka
@Wait WaitMode:0.1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Alisa
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka

[PrintTextModified Text:……啧。|#0202Adv01_Alisa006| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0202Adv01_Nanoka005| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:或许是被她那威严有力的声音镇住了，<br>亚里沙和奈叶香默默地拉开了距离。|#0202Adv01_Narrative061| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia

[PrintTextModified Text:其他人也要保持镇定。<br>请大家控制好自己，千万不要冲动。|#0202Adv01_Leia005| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们必须要团结一致，<br>才能渡过这个难关。|#0202Adv01_Leia006| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_11_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:就当是为了玛格和梅露露她们……<br>至少我们这些幸存下来的人，<br>也要一起逃出这里。|#0202Adv01_Leia007| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@Wait WaitMode:0.5

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅提议，等大家都冷静下来之后，到会客厅集合。<br>说是有事想跟大家商量。|#0202Adv01_Narrative062| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:……希罗，请你务必也要参加。|#0202Adv01_Leia008| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（莫非蕾雅想出了什么越狱的办法？）|#0202Adv01_Hiro021| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（……虽然并不想和她们交好，<br>　但我得掌握囚犯的动向才行）|#0202Adv01_Hiro022|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30,50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro
@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:70,50 IdAndAppearance:Leia

[PrintTextModified Text:……好吧。|#0202Adv01_Hiro023| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:太好了……谢谢你！|#0202Adv01_Leia009| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:听到我的回答，<br>蕾雅露出安心的笑容。|#0202Adv01_Narrative063| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

